#ASSERT `ends fulfilled` (EVALTRACE (`Rules s 74(2) -- I must notify the Operator before I accept my offer of redress` 9) 0 (LIST (EVENT `I, the survivor` `notify the Operator in writing that I accepted the payment offer` 0)))
